### Create a New Job
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EMAIL",
  "payload": {
    "recipient": "test11@example.com",
    "subject": "Hello",
    "body": "This is a test email."
  }
}

### Create a Job designed to FAIL (Simulated Processing Failure)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EMAIL",
  "payload": {
    "recipient": "fail-test@example.com",
    "fail": true
  }
}

### Get Job Details by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/1

### List Jobs (with pagination and filtering)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs?status=PENDING&page=0&size=20

### Process Pending Jobs
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/process
